{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And Noah went out, his sons.</b> One may say: even though they were permitted for marital relations, when they went out he counts them in the order that they were there. The Sages taught: three engaged in relations in the ark: the dog, the raven, and Ham, and all of them were afflicted: the dog was bound, the raven expectorated, Ham was afflicted in his skin."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:02:20.532333203Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}